# 10. ADR-008 — Keep Personal Financial Data Out of GitHub

Date:

2026-10-04

Status:

Accepted

## Decision

The public GitHub repository must not contain real personal financial data.

## Never commit

- Expense history
- Investment records
- Loan records
- Bank information
- Account numbers
- Personal documents
- Passwords
- API keys
- Database credentials
- AWS credentials

## Why

The GitHub repository is intended to become a public DevOps portfolio project.

Public source code and private personal data must remain separate.

## Approach

