# 11. ADR-009 — Do Not Hardcode Secrets

Date:

2026-10-04

Status:

Accepted

## Decision

Credentials and secrets must never be hardcoded into source code.

Examples:

```text
DATABASE_PASSWORD
API_KEYS
AWS_ACCESS_KEYS
OAUTH_SECRETS
```

must be handled through environment variables or appropriate secret-management systems.

## Why

Hardcoded secrets can accidentally be committed to GitHub and exposed.

## Development Direction

Local:

```text
Environment Variables
```

Later:

```text
Cloud Secret Management
```

